{
  "info": {
    "name": "IOES - Exam Suite API",
    "description": "Postman collection for testing Exam Suite microservices.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection\n2. Set `BASE_URL` to `http://localhost:9005`\n3. Enable DEV_AUTH_BYPASS in .env for local dev\n4. JWT token in `{{TOKEN}}` variable or use X-Dev-User-Id header",
